00:00:50.150 --> 00:00:51.184
I mean, for us, it's it's

00:00:51.184 --> 00:00:52.018
it's really difficult

00:00:52.018 --> 00:00:52.852
because it's a

00:00:52.852 --> 00:00:53.686
it's a psychological

00:00:53.686 --> 00:00:55.188
get us stuff in Ukraine

