as lots of houses, people without homes.

00:00:58.425 --> 00:00:59.092
And so on.

00:00:59.092 --> 00:01:00.493
And it's just impossible

00:01:00.493 --> 00:01:01.761
for anyone who knows Ukrainian,

00:01:01.761 --> 00:01:03.329
Polish and Ukrainian people.

00:01:03.329 --> 00:01:04.531
It's just absolutely impossible

00:01:04.531 --> 00:01:04.864
to think

00:01:04.864 --> 00:01:05.632
that we can do this

00:01:05.632 --> 00:01:08.068
with our own population because of them.

00:01:08.568 --> 00:01:09.002
Yeah.

00:01:09.002 --> 00:01:11.271
So it is understandable.

00:01:11.271 --> 00:01:12.072
It is understandable

